        "id": 1,
        "original_url": "https://www.edu.tw/af/News_Content.aspx?n=8FF7FBB5A7A926D1&amp;sms=2E210A7A2BACD6D3&amp;s=7F80BBB344A5B5D2",
        "fallback": "教育部詐騙防制專區",
        "text": "教育部詐騙防制專區",
        "title": "教育部詐騙防制專區",
        "title_link": "https://www.edu.tw/af/News_Content.aspx?n=8FF7FBB5A7A926D1&sms=2E210A7A2BACD6D3&s=7F80BBB344A5B5D2",
